### Authentication
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Prabhakar",
  "role": "bot"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Guest-player"
}

